  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ombudsman Capacity-Building Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">At the request of the Ministry of Public Sector Development (MoPSD) the World Bank is assisting in the capacity-buidling of three directorates of the MoPSD: the HR Directorate, the Restructuring Directorate; and the Service Delivery Improvement Directorate. This will allow MoPSD to better fulfill its mandate and provide assistance in the improvement of public sector services with ministries and agencies with which it cooperates.  The IDF grant will provide capacity-building and assist in the development of strategic planning and quick actions that can be taken, in particular in relation to improving service delivery.  It will also provide the basis for longer-term Bank engagement on this agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
